                "CPLD 和 FPGA 的区别"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6515,
              "lineEnd": 6536,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "a367d0da74906db4d99a524ad1e1ceb599c091f7e4dc9eb5d9f1ace567ac5b95"
